      "key": "anti_ragging_html",
      "value": "<div class=\"space-y-6 font-sans text-xs md:text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\">\n<div class=\"bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded p-4 text-[#2D2D2D]\"><strong class=\"text-[#0A1F44] block mb-0.5 font-serif text-sm\">Strict Zero-Tolerance Anti-Ragging Policy</strong>As per the mandates of the Supreme Court of India and the DCI, ragging in any form is strictly banned inside college dormitories, clinics, and all campus premises. Offenders face immediate rustication and legal action.</div>\n<div class=\"bg-[#0A1F44]/5 p-5 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div><strong class=\"text-[#0A1F44] block mb-1\">National Anti-Ragging Helpline:</strong><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-red-600\">1800-180-5522</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 block font-sans\">Toll-free / 24 Hours active statutory support</span></div><div><strong class=\"text-[#0A1F44] block mb-1\">Institutional Contact:</strong><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-[#1B5E3B]\">gdcdibrugarh@gmail.com</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-400 block font-sans\">Student Welfare Cell / Principal Office</span></div></div>\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">Notice No. GDCD/17/26/6972, dated 01/10/2026, issued by the Office of the Principal, Government Dental College, Dibrugarh. <a href=\"https://vxwiodvtgssvthractow.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/uploads/downloads/1791385597611-anti-ragging-committee-notice.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-[#0A1F44] hover:text-[#D4870A] font-bold hover:underline\">View / download the official notice (PDF)</a></p>\n<h3 class=\"font-serif text-lg font-bold text-[#0A1F44] pt-4\">Anti-Ragging Committee</h3>\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto border border-gray-200 rounded-lg text-xs md:text-sm\"><table class=\"w-full text-left\"><thead class=\"bg-[#0A1F44] text-white font-ui uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px] font-semibold\"><tr><th class=\"px-6 py-3.5\">Sl. No.</th><th class=